---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { business } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Notice" description="How Ankit Jobs & Staffing India collects, stores and uses the details submitted through its candidate and recruiter forms." noindex>
  <PageHero title="Your Information Deserves Care." eyebrow="Privacy notice" text="How we handle the details you share through our candidate and recruiter forms."/>
  <section class="section"><article class="container legal-content">
    <div class="draft-banner"><strong>Plain-language notice.</strong><p>This notice describes how the website currently works. It should be reviewed by a legal professional for the applicable Indian requirements.</p></div>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p><strong>Candidate Zone:</strong> name, father’s and mother’s names, gender, date of birth and age, mobile and optional alternative mobile, email, qualification, state, district and an optional resume file.</p>
    <p><strong>Recruiter Zone:</strong> company name, industry, contact person, designation, mobile, email, the service required, job role, number of openings, job location, requirement details and an optional job description file.</p>
    <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
    <p>Only to process your job application or hiring requirement: to contact you, match candidates with suitable opportunities and respond to employer requirements. We do not sell your information.</p>
    <h2>Where it is stored</h2>
    <p>When you submit a form, your details are sent securely (HTTPS) to a private Google Sheet, and any uploaded file is saved to a private Google Drive folder. Both are owned by Ankit Jobs &amp; Staffing India and are accessible only to its authorised team. Google’s own terms and privacy practices apply to that storage.</p>
    <p>The website itself does not use analytics, advertising or tracking tools, and it does not keep form entries in your browser.</p>
    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>We keep submissions only as long as needed for recruitment purposes, and delete them on request.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can ask us to access, correct or delete your details at any time using the contact details below. Please quote the reference number shown after you submitted the form.</p>
    <h2>Contact links and external services</h2>
    <p>Click-to-call, WhatsApp, Facebook and email links open the service you choose. Those services have their own terms and privacy practices.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Ankit Rai — <a href={business.tel}>{business.phone}</a> · <a href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a></p>
  </article></section>
</Layout>
